hiding and was distracted by [[Cherit]]. He and a team of Suits later caught up to Dante's team in the Tomb of Nefertiti. When Dante threw the [[Sceptre of Nefertiti]] into the pool, this Suit brought the staff back to Klaus. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}","text":"This Suit was sent by Klaus, under the instructions of Rassimov, to go after Dante Vale in County Kerry, Ireland. His team of Suits ambushed Scarlet Byrne and Dante's team in the New Grange Passage Tomb but were eventually defeated. [Home Turf]\n\nThis Suit later was sent to Valley of the Kings, Egypt. Here, he investigated a tent where Dante's team was hiding and was distracted by Cherit. He and a team of Suits later caught up to Dante's team in the Tomb of Nefertiti. When Dante threw the Sceptre of Nefertiti into the pool, this Suit brought the staff back to Klaus. [The Sceptre Deception]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Raypulse]]\n* [[Thundercut]]\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"• Augerfrost\n• Raypulse\n• Thundercut"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Bonelasher]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"• Bonelasher"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 029 is a Suit within the Organization. He operates from Vienna, Austria, under Klaus.\n\nHistory\n\nThis Suit was sent by Klaus, under the instructions of Rassimov, to go after Dante Vale in County Kerry, Ireland. His team of Suits ambushed Scarlet Byrne and Dante's team in the New Grange Passage Tomb but were eventually defeated. [Home Turf]\n\nThis Suit later was sent to Valley of the Kings, Egypt. Here, he investigated a tent where Dante's team was hiding and was distracted by Cherit. He and a team of Suits later caught up to Dante's team in the Tomb of Nefertiti. When Dante threw the Sceptre of Nefertiti into the pool, this Suit brought the staff back to Klaus. [The Sceptre Deception]\n\nAbilities\n\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans.\n\nSpells Utilized\n\n• Augerfrost\n• Raypulse\n• Thundercut\n\nBonded Titans\n\n• Bonelasher","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image     = File:Unnamed Suit 029.png\n| aliases   = \n| relations = \n| base      = [[Vienna, Austria]]\n| group     = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| first     = \"[[Home Turf]]\"\n| last      = \n| gender    = Male\n| hair      = Blonde\n| eyes      = Brown\n| va        = \n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 029''' is a [[Suit]] within [[the Organization]]. He operates from  [[Vienna, Austria]], under [[Klaus]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was sent by [[Klaus]], under the instructions of [[Rassimov]], to go after [[Dante Vale]] in [[County Kerry, Ireland]]. His team of Suits ambushed [[Scarlet Byrne]] and Dante's team in the [[New Grange Passage Tomb]] but were eventually defeated. {{source|Home Turf}}\n\nThis Suit later was sent to [[Valley of the Kings, Egypt]]. Here, he investigated a tent where Dante's team was hiding and was distracted by [[Cherit]]. He and a team of Suits later caught up to Dante's team in the Tomb of Nefertiti. When Dante threw the [[Sceptre of Nefertiti]] into the pool, this Suit brought the staff back to Klaus. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Raypulse]]\n* [[Thundercut]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* [[Bonelasher]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:8234","status":"resolved","target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3228","status":"resolved","target_title":"Home Turf","label":"Home Turf","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Home_Turf","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3228"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8234","status":"resolved","target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3241","status":"resolved","target_title":"Klaus","label":"Klaus","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3241"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3241","status":"resolved","target_title":"Klaus","label":"Klaus","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3241"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2090","status":"resolved","target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2006","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","targe